  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.46,
   "text": "This AI skill lets you save thousands of dollars a month on AI tools by taking the"
  },
  {
   "start": 3.46,
   "end": 7.92,
   "text": "system prompts of the top models like CloudFable 5 and GPT 5.6 Sol and putting them in cheaper"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.92,
   "end": 12.54,
   "text": "models. And it has over 62,000 stars on GitHub. All you do is run one command in your terminal"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.54,
   "end": 15.64,
   "text": "and you'll be able to access the system prompts for all the top models like ChatGPT,"
  },
  {
   "start": 15.74,
   "end": 19.8,
   "text": "Cloud, Gemini, Grok. Now, the dumbest models perform just as well as the best models at a"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.8,
   "end": 22.0,
   "text": "fraction of the price. Comment tools and I'll send it immediately."
  }
